@@ -2,6 +2,15 @@
 
 This project is a sample news application built with Astro, designed to serve as a testing ground for new features in Chrome DevTools.
 
+## Agent tools
+
+The authentication forms expose declarative [WebMCP tools](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api) in supporting browsers:
+
+- `sign-in` on `/signin` signs in with an existing account.
+- `sign-up` on `/signup` creates an account.
+
+Both tools take required `username` and `password` parameters and use the same client-side submission handlers as the forms. Submissions return the success or error message to the agent without exposing authentication tokens. The forms retain the browser's default user review step (no `toolautosubmit`) and work normally in browsers without WebMCP support.
+
 
 ```sh
 pnpm install && pnpm run start
